<title>USA: Alcan March ingot unchanged at 81 cents/lb.</title>
<headline>Alcan March ingot unchanged at 81 cents/lb.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Limited said its list price for ingot in the U.S. for March will remain unchanged from February at 81 cents per pound, with billet also unchanged from the previous month at 91 cents per pound.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
